# Native folders — Expo CNG generates these via `expo prebuild`.
# Should NOT be committed: EAS Build creates them fresh in the cloud
# and uses app.json for native config. Local ios/ android/ folders
# would override app.json (orientation, scheme, icon, splash, and
# infoPlist entries like ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption).
# See: https://docs.expo.dev/workflow/prebuild/#usage-with-eas-build
/ios
/android

